{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgsuQDP7w9HDBtgKzUXfC","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Nearly all the remaining cycles have the same shape: an E=0 connection to a lone two-liberty stone next to a big opponent chain, often in games I was winning by 15–37 points. About half happen at the four corners. At a corner the whole pattern (lone stone, its liberties, and whether the adjacent opponent stone is a lone atari stone) lies within distance 2. I can therefore detect it exactly with 8 spare L6 units, one per corner-neighbour pair, with an exemption for genuine captures of a lone stone. I'll add these to the v8 structure with a prior midway between B and D, since those two tied.\n\n```python\nsrc=open('/work/build8.py').read()\nsrc=src.replace(\"\"\"    b[G1]=-Q['s0']; b[G2]=-Q['s1']\"\"\",\"\"\"    b[G1]=-Q['s0']; b[G2]=-Q['s1']\n    # corner cycle-start detectors (units 488..495)\n    CORN=[]\n    u=488\n    for e in (0,8,72,80):\n        for n in NB[e]:\n            m=[x for x in NB[e] if x!=n][0]\n            W[OWN+n,u]+=2; W[OPP+m,u]+=1\n            for q in NB[n]:\n                if q!=e: W[OPP+q,u]+=1; W[OWN+q,u]-=3\n            W[NX0+m,u]-=2; W[NX1+m,u]-=2\n            for r in NB[m]:\n                if r!=e: W[OPP+r,u]+=2\n            b[u]=-3\n            CORN.append((u,e)); u+=1\n    Q['_corn']=CORN\"\"\")\nsrc=src.replace(\"\"\"    b[81]=Q['pass_logit']\n    T['out.W']=W\"\"\",\"\"\"    for (u,e) in Q['_corn']: W[u,e]-=Q['w_corner']\n    b[81]=Q['pass_logit']\n    T['out.W']=W\"\"\")\nsrc=src.replace(\"pass_logit=-5.0,\",\"pass_logit=-5.0,w_corner=40.0,\")\nopen('/work/build8e.py','w').write(src)\nexec(src)\nPE=dict(t1=2.5,W_o=0.3,prior={0:-2.0,1:1.3,2:1.5,3:0.7,4:0.9},prior_late={0:-1.0,1:0.4,2:0.55,3:0.35,4:0.35})\nT=build(PE)\nfor k,v in T.items(): save(k,v)\nimport json; json.dump({k:(v if not isinstance(v,dict) else {str(a):c for a,c in v.items()}) for k,v in PE.items()},open('/work/v8E_params.json','w'))\nprint('saved v8E', T['out.W'][488:496].min(axis=1))\n```"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":4,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3092,"cache_read_input_tokens":461370,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3092},"output_tokens":8,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"fea22f52-dc2f-44b9-a9cd-4bab4d2abe73","uuid":"81abd0ec-2b16-4e3d-8766-b7a66d24f358","timestamp":"2026-11-09T19:27:33.856Z","request_id":"req_011CgsuQB9BB8iMR3E5mRVFo"}
